'''London''' is the capital and largest city of [[England]] and the [[United Kingdom]]. Standing on the [[River Thames]], it has been a major settlement for two millennia and remains one of the world's foremost cultural, financial and tourist destinations.

==See==
{{listing
| name=Tower of London | alt=Her Majesty's Royal Palace and Fortress | url=https://www.hrp.org.uk/tower-of-london/
| lat=51.5081 | long=-0.0759 | directions=Tower Hill tube
| content=A historic castle on the north bank of the River Thames, home to the Crown Jewels and centuries of history.
}}

There is a great deal more to see along the river, but the museums are the real draw for many visitors.

{{listing
| name=British Museum | alt= | url=https://www.britishmuseum.org/
